        "content": "import pytest\nfrom agent.graph import (\n    AUTO_APPLY_CONFIDENCE_THRESHOLD,\n    AUTO_APPLY_MAX_SEVERITY,\n    should_auto_apply,\n)\n\ndef test_applies_at_or_above_threshold_and_low_severity():\n    assert should_auto_apply(confidence=AUTO_APPLY_CONFIDENCE_THRESHOLD, severity=AUTO_APPLY_MAX_SEVERITY)\n    assert should_auto_apply(confidence=1.0, severity=1)\n\ndef test_rejects_just_below_confidence_threshold():\n    assert not should_auto_apply(confidence=AUTO_APPLY_CONFIDENCE_THRESHOLD - 0.01, severity=1)\n\ndef test_rejects_severity_above_max_regardless_of_confidence():\n    # Both severity 3 and 4 must never auto-apply, even at confidence 1.0.\n    for severity in (3, 4):\n        assert not should_auto_apply(confidence=1.0, severity=severity)\n\ndef test_both_conditions_required_never_either():\n    assert not should_auto_apply(confidence=0.0, severity=1)\n    assert not should_auto_apply(confidence=1.0, severity=4)\n\n@pytest.mark.parametrize(\"confidence,severity,expected\", [\n    (0.85, 2, True), (0.849999, 2, False), (0.90, 3, False), (0.50, 1, False),\n])\ndef test_gate_matrix(confidence, severity, expected):\n    assert should_auto_apply(confidence=confidence, severity=severity) is expected\n```\n\n",
