        "title": "1.4 `CanonModel` / Pydantic contract behavior — `engine/pipeline/schema.py`",
        "content": "Untested: camelCase wire round-trip, the `prefer_source` cross-field validator, numeric range constraints, and `extra=\"forbid\"` rejecting unknown wire fields (a real risk vector — the web layer could send an extra field silently if this weren't enforced).\n\n```python\n",
